<title>GREECE: Greek/Bund gap widens to 357 bps, 251 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>Greek/Bund gap widens to 357 bps, 251 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened a shade to 357 basis points today from 355 on Wednesday at 0957 GMT.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 251 basis points from 246 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.21%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.64%	357	355 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.54%	367	367 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.70%	251	246 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.36%	285	282 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.31%	290	284 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.19%	202	209 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.51%	270	265 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
